{
  "formTitle": "CLETS-001 Confidential Information for Law Enforcement",
  "_comment": "DV-100 page 13 names CLETS-001 as one of the three forms the filer must complete, so it is always filed. It asks about the same two people the packet already knows - and gives them the packet's names, so the answers travel - plus the identifying detail only this form wants: other names used, marks and scars, driver's license, vehicle, employer, and whether either person speaks English. Only 'Date received by court' is the court's; the case number box says the court fills it, but it is the packet's caption everywhere else and is left as one here too. The three push buttons are omitted; the sanitizer strips them.",
